{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48854","headline":"观泗州李常侍打球 · 张祜","name":"观泗州李常侍打球","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日出树烟红，开场画鼓雄。\n骤骑鞍上月，轻拨镫前风。\n斗转时乘势，旁捎乍迸空。\n等来低背手，争得旋分騣。\n远射门斜入，深排马迥通。\n遥知三殿下，长恨出征东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48854.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48854","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}